PTX CoWR+red.v2.cluster
"A thread's .cluster vector red.add, then its own loads of both elements: does it miss its own update?"
{
x=0;
y=0;
P0:r0=0;
P0:r1=0;
}
 P0@cta 0,cluster 0,gpu 0                         ;
 red.relaxed.cluster.global.v2.f32.add x, y, 1, 1 ;
 ld.relaxed.cluster.global r0, x                  ;
 ld.relaxed.cluster.global r1, y                  ;
exists
(P0:r0 == 0 \/ P0:r1 == 0)
